    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56156" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατωμάδ-ιος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰδ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦμος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>from the shoulder</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίσκος κ.</span> a quoit <i>thrown down from the
			shoulder</i>, i.e. from the upturned hand held above the shoulder,
				<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.431
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>worn</i> or <i>borne on the shoulder</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Cer.</u>
				45
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Mosch.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				4
			</span></i>.</div>
